{"about_the_game":"METALLIC CHILD x Sakuna: Of Rice and Ruin Crossover Custom 'Kokorowa'<br><br>The first DLC of METALLIC CHILD is a crossover with <i>Sakuna: Of Rice and Ruin</i>!<br>An additional Kokorowa Custom with exclusive weapons!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-A robotic Kokorowa!</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862492/extras/Steam_custom_k.gif?t=1675213472\" /><br>A Custom to dress up Rona like Kokorowa!<br>Kokorowa, always poised and dignified!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-Battle with finesse!</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862492/extras/Steam_skill_k.gif?t=1675213472\" /><br>This crossover Custom also includes exclusive weapons.<br>Bring Kokorowa-style finesse to the battlefield of METALLIC CHILD!<br>Will the powers of enlightenment prove to stand against machines of the future??<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-Look out for the changes in the field!</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862492/extras/Steam_stage.gif?t=1675213472\" /><br>It's not just a matter of looks, many changes can be found in the field, so don't miss them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-A fierce boss!</strong></h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862492/extras/Steam_boss_k.gif?t=1675213472\" /><br>&quot;Black Shadow&quot; will be waiting for you as the Keeper.<br>But, wait! What's that on its sides?<br>An onslaught of melee and energy ball attacks!!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1862492?t=1675213472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1862492?t=1675213472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1862492/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1675213472","capsule_imagev5":"https://